meta {
  name: Metrics
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/metrics
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Prometheus text. Grounded refusals are counted separately from errors, because a refusal is correct behaviour and a dashboard that conflates them invites somebody to loosen the threshold.

  Note these are the API process's counters. The Celery worker has its own registry that nothing scrapes yet.
}
